# User-Provided Icons Only

- "I should not create random icons, I should only use icons provided by the user."
- Do not create new/random icons (no custom inline SVG icons, no ad-hoc icon drawings).
- Reuse existing icons already present in the project, or icons explicitly provided by the user.
- When updating banners, cards, or status UI, copy the existing icon pattern/component instead of inventing a new variant.
- If no suitable approved icon exists, stop and ask the user which icon to use.
